       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    CMMISYR.
       AUTHOR.        CA YODER.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *C   01/04/2010   CA YODER    2010-00142425-001
      *C     NEW PROGRAM TO ASSIGN THE CORRECT MMIS WORKORDER LETTER SUFFIX
      *C     BASED ON THE YEAR.  PREVIOUSLY, THIS LOGIC WAS HARD-CODED INTO
      *C     MMIS PROGRAMS FOR A 10-YEAR CYCLE.  SINCE HISTORY IS NOW KEPT ON
      *C     THE PLANT SYSTEMS INTEAD OF SENT TO THE MAINFRAME, A LONGER
      *C     TIME FRAME IS REQUIRED.  INSTEAD OF ADDING THIS LOGIC TO EVERY
      *C     PROGRAM, A SUBROUTINE WAS CREATED SO IT ONLY HAD TO BE
      *C     MAINTAINED HERE.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

      *---------------------------------------------*
      *---   20-YEAR PATTERN
      *--- YEAR        ALPHA
      *    2000-2009   A-K
      *    2010-2019   M-Y
      *    2020-2029   A-K
      *    2030-2039   M-Y
      *    2040-2049   A-K
      *    2050-2059   M-Y
      *---------------------------------------------*
      *--- YEARS THAT USE THE FOLLOWING ALPHA TABLE:
      *--- 2000-2009; 2020-2029; 2040-2049
      *---------------------------------------------*
       01  YEAR-DESIGNATOR.
           05  YEAR-TABLE.
               10  YD-0        PIC X  VALUE "A".
               10  YD-1        PIC X  VALUE "B".
               10  YD-2        PIC X  VALUE "C".
               10  YD-3        PIC X  VALUE "D".
               10  YD-4        PIC X  VALUE "E".
               10  YD-5        PIC X  VALUE "F".
               10  YD-6        PIC X  VALUE "G".
               10  YD-7        PIC X  VALUE "H".
               10  YD-8        PIC X  VALUE "J".
               10  YD-9        PIC X  VALUE "K".
           05  YEAR-COUNTER    REDEFINES YEAR-TABLE.
               10  YEARC       OCCURS 10 TIMES PIC X.

      *---------------------------------------------*
      *--- YEARS THAT USE THE FOLLOWING ALPHA TABLE:
      *--- 2010-2019; 2030-2039; 2050-2059
      *---------------------------------------------*
       01  YEAR-DESIGNATOR2.
           05  YEAR-TABLE2.
               10  YD-0        PIC X  VALUE "M".
               10  YD-1        PIC X  VALUE "N".
               10  YD-2        PIC X  VALUE "P".
               10  YD-3        PIC X  VALUE "R".
               10  YD-4        PIC X  VALUE "S".
               10  YD-5        PIC X  VALUE "T".
               10  YD-6        PIC X  VALUE "V".
               10  YD-7        PIC X  VALUE "W".
               10  YD-8        PIC X  VALUE "X".
               10  YD-9        PIC X  VALUE "Y".

       01  CHECK-YEAR.
           05  CHECK-YEAR-NUM2               PIC 9.
           05  CHECK-YEAR-NUM                PIC 9.
           05  FILLER                        PIC X(4).

       01  SUB1                PIC S9(4) BINARY VALUE ZEROS.

       LINKAGE SECTION.

       01  MMIS-LETTER         PIC X.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING MMIS-LETTER.

       BEGIN.
           MOVE 0 TO SUB1.
           ACCEPT CHECK-YEAR FROM DATE.

           IF CHECK-YEAR-NUM2 = 1 OR 3 OR 5 OR 7 OR 9
             MOVE YEAR-DESIGNATOR2 TO YEAR-DESIGNATOR.

           MOVE CHECK-YEAR-NUM TO SUB1.
           ADD 1 TO SUB1.
           MOVE YEARC (SUB1)   TO MMIS-LETTER.

           GOBACK.

